  "description": "<h1>Wired RGB Gaming Mouse 7D, USB Interface, Ergonomic Right-Handed Design for Desktop &amp; Laptop</h1><img src=\"https://test.ebuyl.com/api/v1/files/products/2026/08/15/9ee7c978838379fef6c6394361471a87.jpg\" alt=\"Wired RGB gaming mouse 7D ergonomic right-handed USB\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><h2>Core Selling Points</h2><p>This wired gaming mouse combines a 7D button configuration with a comfortable, right-handed ergonomic shape to support extended gaming and work sessions.</p><ul><li><p><strong>7D Button Configuration:</strong> Multiple programmable buttons provide quick access to essential commands, enhancing in-game responsiveness and workflow efficiency.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ergonomic Right-Handed Design:</strong> The contoured shape follows the natural curve of the right hand, reducing strain during prolonged use.</p></li><li><p><strong>USB Wired Connectivity:</strong> A stable, lag-free wired connection ensures consistent tracking and instant response, compatible with both desktops and laptops.</p></li><li><p><strong>RGB Lighting Effects:</strong> Vibrant RGB illumination adds a dynamic visual element to your gaming station, with a stylish look that complements any setup.</p></li><li><p></p></li></ul><img src=\"https://test.ebuyl.com/api/v1/files/products/2026/08/24/395e95fbf685823e34d40dc4fc3455d8.jpg\" alt=\"Wired RGB gaming mouse 7D side view\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><h2>Product Specifications</h2><table style=\"min-width: 50px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Attribute</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Brand</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>OGHKO</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Model</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>7D Wired RGB Gaming Mouse</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Interface</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>USB Wired</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Button Count</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>7D (7-button configuration)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Design</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Ergonomic, Right-Handed</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Lighting</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>RGB</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Compatibility</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Desktop &amp; Laptop Computers</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Connection Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Wired (USB)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Use Scenarios</h2><p>This mouse is ideal for a variety of settings. For gamers, the 7D buttons and precise tracking provide an edge in fast-paced titles such as FPS, MOBA, and battle royale games. For office professionals, the ergonomic shape supports comfortable all-day use for document editing, spreadsheet work, and web browsing. It also suits general home computing, media consumption, and online learning, making it a versatile companion for both desktop and laptop users.</p><img src=\"https://test.ebuyl.com/api/v1/files/products/2026/08/24/9684d415318243d093b949ef113b4a41.jpg\" alt=\"Wired RGB gaming mouse 7D top view\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><h2>Installation Instructions</h2><ol><li><p>Locate an available USB port on your desktop or laptop computer.</p></li><li><p>Plug the mouse's USB connector firmly into the port.</p></li><li><p>Wait a few seconds for the operating system to recognize the device automatically (no driver installation is required).</p></li><li><p>Once the RGB lighting activates, the mouse is ready for use.</p></li><li><p></p></li></ol><h2></h2><h2>Care &amp; Use</h2><p>Keep the mouse clean by wiping the surface with a soft, dry cloth. Avoid exposing it to liquids, extreme heat, or direct sunlight. Unplug the USB cable when not in use for extended periods to maintain optimal performance.</p>",
